Emilli Remote for Android ("Emilli 원격"), branch android-153
=============================================================

This branch is the complete corresponding source of the Android app
"Emilli 원격" (package net.emillis.remote) that LoomNaru Labs Inc builds,
version 1.5.3, versionCode 73. It is a modified version of RustDesk, the open
source remote desktop software by Purslane Tech Pte. Ltd. and the RustDesk
contributors (https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk). RustDesk is licensed
under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 (AGPL-3.0); see the
file LICENCE. This modified version is distributed under the same licence,
without any warranty.

Base: RustDesk tag 1.5.3, commit 95cca3f661f635b3cc85c04935fe8d96d8f432ef,
with libs/hbb_common at commit fae47e024dd83cef6aaecde0aa7d11731df11649
(https://github.com/rustdesk/hbb_common) included as plain files (the import
commit, whose parent is the 1.5.0 import shared with main and android-play).
The same changes on 1.5.0 are on branch android-play.

Changes, each in its own commit after the base:

1. .github/workflows: upstream's workflows are removed.
2. libs/hbb_common/src/config.rs: the built-in ID server is rd.emillis.net
   and the built-in public key is that server's key.
3. flutter/android/app/build.gradle, AndroidManifest.xml: package
   net.emillis.remote and the app name "Emilli 원격".
4. src/common.rs: when no account (API) server is saved, the app uses
   https://rd.emillis.net; src/flutter_ffi.rs: on Android direct IP access
   ("direct-server") is always off.
5. src/common.rs: the app never asks RustDesk's servers for a new version;
   updates come from Google Play or the administrator.
6. src/lang/en.rs, src/lang/ko.rs: the input permission notice says what the
   Accessibility service does, that it reads the focused text field only to
   type into it, and that nothing it reads is stored or sent.
7. flutter/android/app/src/main/res: Emilli launcher and notification icons
   and the icon background colour.
8. build-android/: the build recipe (Docker toolchain, build steps, the same
   changes as patch files for the 1.5.0 recipe, the icon drawing script).
   NOTICE and .github/README.md are new.
9. flutter/android/app/src/main/res/drawable/floating_window.xml and
   flutter/assets/icon.svg: the Emilli Remote drawing replaces RustDesk's logo
   in the floating window and the in-app icon; AndroidManifest.xml and
   res/values/strings.xml: the Accessibility service is named "Emilli 원격 입력"
   and its description and the app_name string say Emilli; the input
   permission notice names that service.
10. flutter/lib (common, desktop and mobile pages), src/lang/en.rs and ko.rs,
   src/flutter_ffi.rs: the codec choice titled "Codec" with one plain line
   under each choice, reachable from the main settings page on phones and
   first in Settings > Display on computers; the codec in use shown on the
   computer's session toolbar; plain words when a Windows confirmation window
   is open on a PC that runs the app without installing it, with one Install
   button on that PC.
11. flutter/pubspec.yaml: version 1.5.3, versionCode 73 (the patches above
   left upstream's version line).
12. .github/workflows/build-android-emilli.yml and build-android/ci/: the
   build on GitHub (unsigned; the Play upload is signed on the build PC).

